# FIFA 2026 Autonomous Simulator - AI Guidelines

- Goal: We are building an enterprise-grade Agentic RAG platform simulating the 2026 World Cup.
- Tech Stack: Python 3.11, FastAPI, PostgreSQL (with pgvector), SQLAlchemy, LangChain, Docker.
- Rules:
  - Write clean, modular Python code.
  - Never use SQLite; always assume a PostgreSQL database.
  - Provide complete, copy-pasteable files, avoiding placeholders.
  - Always separate database schemas (models) from API endpoints (routers).